  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Resilience Facility (PRF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Pacific Resilience Facility is a Pacific owned, led and designed initiative endorsed by Pacific Island Forum (PIF) Leaders to generate funds for smaller-scale climate resilience projects. The fund will enhance Pacific access to climate finance and fund climate change resilience initiatives in the Pacific region to build community resilience to climate change and disasters.</narrative>
  </description>
